      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "The Being's environmental message, however heavy-handed, aligns with contemporary eco-horror like **Prophecy** (1979) and **Alligator** (1980). These films channeled post-Three Mile Island nuclear anxieties and growing awareness of industrial pollution into monster movie frameworks. While bigger budget entries like **The Host** (2006) would later perfect this formula, **The Being** represents the scrappy, regional filmmaking approach to similar themes."
